# Start

Source: https://docs.invalid/engine/learn/book/start/

A garden:

```rust
/// A garden of rows.
pub struct Garden {
    pub rows: u8,
}
```

Its rows alone:

```rust
    pub rows: u8,
```

Then read [the rows' file](https://docs.invalid/engine/learn/book/later/index.md#the-rows), with the plan
beside it:

![The plan](https://docs.invalid/engine/learn/book/start/plan.svg)

